OL,3,AWildlife park reopens after man killed
OL,4,Aby tiger
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Wildlife Park has reopened
OL,7,Ffor the first time since a man was
OL,8,Fkilled by a tiger in an enclosure.
OL,10,FWilliam Chapman, 24, was mauled to
OL,11,Fdeath at the park near Doncaster on
OL,12,FSaturday. The public were evacuated
OL,13,Fafter the incident with the attraction
OL,14,Fclosed since then.
OL,16,FAn inquest that opened into Chapman's
OL,17,Fdeath on Thursday heard of his history
OL,18,Fof mental illness and a diagnosis of
OL,19,Fschizophrenia. His family expressed
OL,20,Fconcerns about his contact with mental
OL,21,Fhealth services leading up to his
OL,22,Fdeath.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
